  "title": "Price Extra Arms and the monk third hand after the arm count",
  "description": "Follow-up from !1, which replaced the four-arm flag with an arm count. The open items are recorded in `docs/ongoing-projects/EXTRA_LIMB_MECHANICS.md#open-balance-work`.\n\n- Extra Arms still costs 3 race points per rank, the price set when a rank was one extra swing. A rank is now one full arm. The doc suggests 7.5 RP for each rank that adds the third or fourth arm and 1 RP for each rank past four, but equal pricing is not established: the third arm alone opens lower gloves and sleeves.\n- Pricing for mixed Four Arms, Extra Arms and race adjustments is undecided, and so is whether the Thri-Kreen cap exception applies.\n- Four Arms stays at 15 RP. The unarmed monk third hand raises its value for monks, and that value is not priced.\n- Before deploying: Extra Arms grants on saved characters or staff-built items now mean arms instead of swings. Check them.",
